    shape: axis-aligned plus (center + up/down/left/right), 5 cells if interior, 3-4 if center on grid edge
    composition: each plus has 2-4 yellow cells and 1-3 grey cells; yellow+grey = plus size
    yellow_connectivity: yellow cells within each plus form one 8-connected component
    uniqueness: each 8-connected yellow component maps to exactly one plus center
    non_overlap: plus motifs share no cells with each other
